    },
    "已断开。音乐应用和其他浏览器的登录不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disconnected from Apple Music in Cueto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已断开。音乐应用和其他浏览器的登录不受影响。"
