    "本应用暂时无法取得 MusicKit 开发者凭据（%lld）；网页直连可单独测试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not obtain MusicKit developer credentials (%lld). You can still test the web connection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本应用暂时无法取得 MusicKit 开发者凭据（%lld）；网页直连可单独测试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本应用的 MusicKit 开发者凭据可用；这尚不证明具备歌词权限。": {
